  "goodToKnow": "Rechtens means lawful or legal and is only used with sein: Das ist (nicht) rechtens. It's an old genitive form of das Recht that became fixed. Before nouns you need rechtmäßig or legal: eine rechtmäßige Kündigung. Similar fossilised genitives: abends, morgens, rechtens, eilends. Courts often decide whether something war rechtens."
